&lt;p>&lt;strong>Start here:&lt;/strong> Check your &lt;a href="https://utilityexplained.com/blog/what-is-a-kilowatt-hour/">kWh usage&lt;/a> against last month. Then verify whether your &lt;a href="https://utilityexplained.com/blog/10-fixed-vs-variable-utility-rate/">rate plan&lt;/a> changed. If neither explains it, work through the 12 causes below.&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>